[{"id": 35459844, "text": "<h2>You Will Need:</h2>\nA reading book. In can be a book from school, from the library or from home. Before you start, check the book has some speech marks in it!\n<br></br>\n<h2>The Activity:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Find some inverted commas in your book.</li>\n<li>Which words are being spoken? </li>\n<li>Who is talking?</li>\n<li>Does the writing tell you how they are talking?</li>\n<li>Have a go at reading the sentence (including the part outside the speech marks which tells you who said it). Try using a different voice when the character is speaking!</li>\n<li>Have another go with some different sentences in the book! Can you use different voices for different characters?</li>\n</ol>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 35459552, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40849054, "text": "\n“I love your hair!” said Janine.\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 32, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35459552, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p><span style=\"font-size:32px;font-family:SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">\n“I love your hair!” said Janine.\n</span></p>", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40849045, "text": "Speech marks are sometimes called inverted commas, and they are used in writing to show when someone is speaking. Here is an example:\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35459552, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 35459702, "text": "In this example, you can see how the 66-shaped inverted commas show where the speech begins, and the 99-shaped inverted commas show where the speech ends. \n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": "1633942409567_1image1-01FHQ8WQ9VKSQ5W96GJPAQ3C3S.j